{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他把喜欢投入得很尽兴，连渴望也成了心里的满足。依赖中的片刻自在，让他能享受投入本身。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他体验到，投入亲近时，渴望本身也能带来满足。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文在依赖中尝到的自在，为他此刻尽情享受渴望提供了具体的心理依据，也能解释这段不再拘谨的投入感。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"欢喜里已经有了舍不得，他越享受亲近，越盼这份靠近延续。亲近曾给过他真实安慰，因此这份快乐也牵动着他的安稳。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他在满足最深时，已会生出眷恋，舍不得亲近结束。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"亲近早已成为他的安稳依靠，因此把这一段的热情理解为对珍贵关系的留恋与延续之愿，有前文经历作支撑，段尾的短暂收束也为这种感受提供了依据。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选11\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "233b68f7-68a8-4b4b-91ff-33701246247f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T021651080027Z", "elapsed_seconds": 158.609, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:19:29.707301+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4f3f6f56c20f2e52861c8a511dc92c014ed8f599ff81bb7b59e836f64a20ac22", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\